{"version":2,"width":104,"height":30,"timestamp":1785232800,"env":{"SHELL":"/bin/bash","TERM":"xterm-256color"},"title":"MCP Hub - observation-first troubleshooting"}
[0.2,"o","$ claude \"Why is Jellyfin unreachable? Observe first and ask before changing anything.\"\r\n"]
[1.0,"o","\r\nClaude: I will inspect the configured endpoint before considering a correction.\r\n"]
[1.8,"o","\r\n> diagnose_endpoint {\"endpoint\":\"media\"}\r\n"]
[2.4,"o","  phase: observation\r\n  assessment: {\"healthy\": false}\r\n  observations: {\"status\": 502, \"latency_ms\": 41}\r\n  correction_applied: false\r\n"]
[3.4,"o","\r\nClaude: The proxy is reachable but its upstream is failing. I will inspect the service.\r\n"]
[4.1,"o","\r\n> diagnose_service {\"service\":\"jellyfin.service\",\"host\":\"media\"}\r\n"]
[4.8,"o","  phase: observation\r\n  assessment: {\"active_state\":\"failed\",\"healthy\":false}\r\n  observations.state: Result=exit-code, ExecMainStatus=1, NRestarts=3\r\n  observations.journal: bind: address already in use\r\n  correction_applied: false\r\n"]
[6.0,"o","\r\nClaude: Jellyfin is stopped after three failed starts. The port conflict has cleared.\r\n"]
[6.6,"o","Claude: I can restart only jellyfin.service on media, then re-run both checks.\r\n"]
[7.1,"o","\r\n> plan_mutation {\"tool\":\"service_ctl\",\"arguments\":{\"service\":\"jellyfin.service\",\"action\":\"restart\",\"host\":\"media\"}}\r\n"]
[7.8,"o","  status: confirmation_required\r\n  warning: confirm_mutation will execute this exact call once\r\n  confirmation_token: demo-token-redacted\r\n"]
[9.0,"o","\r\nClaude: Confirm this exact restart? (No other service or host will be changed.)\r\n"]
[10.0,"o","User: Confirm.\r\n"]
[10.5,"o","\r\n> confirm_mutation {\"confirmation_token\":\"demo-token-redacted\"}\r\n"]
[11.2,"o","  status: executed\r\n  tool: service_ctl\r\n  result: {\"service\":\"jellyfin.service\",\"action\":\"restart\",\"host\":\"media\",\"return_code\":0}\r\n"]
[12.2,"o","\r\n> diagnose_service {\"service\":\"jellyfin.service\",\"host\":\"media\"}\r\n"]
[12.8,"o","  assessment: {\"active_state\":\"active\",\"healthy\":true}\r\n  correction_applied: false\r\n"]
[13.6,"o","\r\n> diagnose_endpoint {\"endpoint\":\"media\"}\r\n"]
[14.2,"o","  assessment: {\"healthy\":true}\r\n  observations: {\"status\":200,\"latency_ms\":36}\r\n  correction_applied: false\r\n"]
[15.3,"o","\r\nClaude: Jellyfin is active and the endpoint now returns HTTP 200. One confirmed restart was applied;\r\n"]
[15.5,"o","Claude: no configuration, DNS, tunnel, or other service was changed.\r\n"]
[16.2,"o","\r\n$ \r\n"]
